OL,3,AMan, 41, and boy, 16, arrested after
OL,4,Acar damaged by gunshots
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested after
OL,7,Farmed police responded to an incident
OL,8,Fin which a car was hit by gunshots.
OL,10,FSouth Wales Police said a vehicle on
OL,11,Fthe A48 in Morriston, Swansea,
OL,12,Fsustained damage "consistent with a
OL,13,Ffirearms discharge" on Friday.
OL,15,FA 41-year-old man from Llansamlet,
OL,16,FSwansea, had been arrested on suspicion
OL,17,Fof possessing a firearm with intent to
OL,18,Fendanger life, while a 16-year-old boy,
OL,19,Falso from Llansamlet, had been arrested
OL,20,Fon suspicion of affray.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
